        "original_id": "7a9da400-a0df-5a2e-b127-57539a95ae62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chas Chandler, John Constantine, Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, John Totleben, Jamie Delano, Philip Bond\n- Organizations: DC Comics, Vertigo\n- Products: Hellblazer Special: Bad Blood\n- Topics: Comics, fictional characters, publication, creators\n\nFacts:\n- John Constantine is a fictional antihero who appears in comic books published by DC Comics and its alternative imprint Vertigo.\n- John Constantine was created by Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, and John Totleben, and he debuted in 2 No. 25 in June 1984.\n- Chas Chandler is John Constantine's closest and longest surviving friend, and Chas Chandler acts as his sidekick and cab driver.\n- Hellblazer Special: Bad Blood was written by Jamie Delano and illustrated by Philip Bond, and it features John Constantine several decades after most of his series continuity.",
